    "task_id": "sheet_only_05",
    "instruction": "Open the spreadsheet at http://localhost:3000/spreadsheet. You will calculate a power and round the result to 2 decimal places.\n\n1. In cell A1, enter the base number: 3.\n2. In cell A2, enter the exponent: 4.\n3. In cell B1, use the POWER function to raise A1 to the power of A2.\n4. In cell B2, use the ROUND function to round the result of B1 divided by 7, to 2 decimal places.",
    "website": "http://localhost:3000/spreadsheet",
    "states": [
      [
        { "match": "exact", "f": "getCellMeta", "param": "A1", "property": ["cell", "v"], "value": 3 },
