    "task_id": "sheet_only_06",
    "instruction": "Open the spreadsheet at http://localhost:3000/spreadsheet. You will record letter grades and count how many students received an 'A'.\n\n1. Enter the following letter grades going down column A:\n   - A1: A\n   - A2: B\n   - A3: A\n   - A4: C\n   - A5: A\n2. In cell B1, use the COUNTIF function to count the number of cells in A1:A5 that contain the letter 'A'.",
    "website": "http://localhost:3000/spreadsheet",
    "states": [
      [
        { "match": "exact", "f": "getCellMeta", "param": "A1", "property": ["cell", "v"], "value": "A" },
