    "instruction": "Open the spreadsheet at http://localhost:3000/spreadsheet. You have 4 test scores and want to analyze only the passing ones (60 or above).\n\n1. Enter the following scores going down column A:\n   - A1: 75\n   - A2: 45\n   - A3: 80\n   - A4: 50\n2. In cell B1, use the SUMIF function to sum only the scores in A1:A4 that are 60 or above.\n3. In cell B2, use the AVERAGEIF function to calculate the average of only the scores in A1:A4 that are 60 or above.",
