    "instruction": "Open the spreadsheet at http://localhost:3000/spreadsheet. You will enter two values at opposite corners of a 2x2 grid and then swap them using cell reference formulas.\n\n1. In cell A1, enter the text: Apple.\n2. In cell B2, enter the text: Orange.\n3. In cell B1, enter a formula that references A1 so that B1 displays the value from A1.\n4. In cell A2, enter a formula that references B2 so that A2 displays the value from B2.\n\nAfter this, the 2x2 grid will show the two values swapped across the diagonal: A1 and B1 both show 'Apple', while A2 and B2 both show 'Orange'.",
